Red Wagon was added in '''Beta 30.0''', starting as a 3/2 for 5G with Haste and a Magic that allowed it to catch an ally monster of your choice. Its Dust would release a freshly new version of the monster, summoned as far left as possible on your board. '''Beta 34.0''' gave it +1 ATK. '''Beta 53.0''' changed its Dust to release it to your deck instead. The released monster will still be reset, but will gain a +3/+3 bonus. '''Beta 53.1''' gave it -1 cost.

